{"objects":[{"id":"flow","instance":"instance--b96dad5f-c519-5a1f-a718-912ca4a86c02","objects":["attack-action--1","attack-action--2","attack-action--3","attack-action--4","attack-action--5","attack-action--6","attack-action--7","attack-action--8","attack-condition--1","attack-condition--2","attack-condition--3","attack-condition--4","instance--c08fb540-8872-51c1-8496-283e65fd40a2","ipv4-addr--1","instance--7797ff9e-6685-5e18-adfb-c4d44716e06f","instance--ea69be26-6559-52d4-8479-a0e32478e751","instance--617d6d5a-1abd-5587-a574-a9e009c202e7","instance--813e024b-d3d5-5a1b-b2fb-8afb64703462","instance--9c3e5700-d251-56ad-98d4-9130ffe9bad0","instance--74196a8e-49e1-5787-8fea-75dd0210ee3f","instance--882dab6b-f62d-5ede-a1a5-baf3953ade28","software--5","instance--becc7795-37fe-5653-834c-15b423ef23c9","instance--f5abc6ee-5e42-5b31-bf5f-1f6c6f6fd16e","instance--aa63845b-3205-57e4-bb7b-e1817b786426","instance--e4f1265c-0d37-5abf-962e-f3c62b611a74","instance--2abde38b-0e53-5744-9006-a43572d80b3b","file--1","instance--f749e06d-1659-5572-b731-b60ef8fd4b2d","instance--ac8bb307-397b-559c-9e5d-e455228400d8","process--1","instance--e4f6f62b-68ab-50e6-b866-2e830fbcac19","instance--ad1f125b-7701-5e9d-b869-79f40471648d","instance--384798bd-a84b-5feb-8d38-7f9d0a087f11","instance--408fcf50-c66e-54f0-b4d4-69a7035e4a2c","instance--7e8c9301-c3f8-55e9-8894-e81f1b6203d9","instance--5fc62bf8-765c-51c3-9c0c-b6f4d8dff47f","instance--68b2abb9-9316-5753-906b-3b549b6a5232","instance--56b40d44-cc57-5e8b-b320-779a685089fd","instance--56da8838-1109-5fce-9d89-7b3ec32d7010","instance--88f25f85-b4d1-57cb-9c54-8afff5236c3b","instance--398dd77a-3adc-5636-b3d7-92103acbdfaf","instance--9bdfd6ac-eebe-553f-86bd-af382747586a","instance--6d5cbf5c-5a40-513f-aaaa-67375fd01db0","instance--ce091466-f1ac-5d1a-85c9-6a359b2025ce","instance--1fa3126a-bb58-563e-a616-464bda46b52f","instance--465c895a-15c7-553e-ba1a-16498ce7bbe9","instance--47f1b8bf-8428-56a7-9879-f132a4dd1930","instance--b2f0fb3e-20a8-5e7f-bb11-04f3a2e6eb5a","instance--f81c2552-4c47-5a5e-9a1c-b672f2b93226","instance--72bdbf69-0c85-5566-9de7-49c101c06dec","instance--dabd444b-1bea-5322-9a12-44362ee6553e","instance--09a00c86-4c4f-5d78-9ed9-37d5f7ba6d0d","instance--d67df2e3-f239-5084-b92d-d2446dc8f121","instance--be236689-232e-5160-8f58-e357acd63845","instance--c97eee1a-0f2f-528f-a147-3db6cfcffbf5","instance--f72c1729-3e7b-5c89-a3d7-54a4bd254178","instance--336d1884-e8ff-58c6-893d-836dcb3031ae","instance--414512ef-6878-5aab-86ce-ba9c73a96859","instance--5313ad17-377c-53ac-a7eb-3ebc6a52c3a9","instance--a3922853-ce07-5012-ab50-6bae29dfe04e","instance--4ac716bd-ed25-541f-b7fc-138b9698d003","instance--91df36be-82ee-5d23-8982-8829e664604d"],"properties":[["name","Compromised AWS access keys used to modify security groups and access EC2"],["description","Expel described an AWS incident in which an attacker used compromised IAM user access keys, enumerated cloud resources and permissions, modified security group ingress rules, created an EC2 SSH key pair, started an existing instance, and ultimately gained command line access to the instance."],["scope","incident"],["author",[["name","Unknown"]]],["external_references",[["item-1",[["source_name","expel.io"],["url","https://expel.io/blog/finding-evil-in-aws/"]]]]]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--ad592d05-6969-5b51-98a8-1ad9b6aab896","120":"instance--5850a8f4-8241-5e73-9bf0-dcd376cd5025","150":"instance--0da1498f-3beb-5916-a249-e0410a4a81e4","180":"instance--d3632784-7391-5a29-83e2-edab51db56c6","210":"instance--8bc47ca5-ca73-5a04-a9ea-918608f10871","240":"instance--6546eef6-c5ad-516e-a417-89916e651648","270":"instance--244e5a69-f465-564e-9d2c-93d4da44fc57","30":"instance--6a1fca3c-fdb6-536a-bbea-61ac2349a700","300":"instance--043a5b44-2864-5565-abce-1909204e5485","330":"instance--e10eb918-2b0b-56f4-9c82-f345ce21276c","60":"instance--33a99d1b-dad8-51f6-be74-e1614db9151b","90":"instance--380c79e9-b1eb-547c-bf01-a011db1201c1"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--1","properties":[["name","Use compromised access keys"],["description","By querying historical CloudTrail events for signs of this attacker, Expel was able to identify that they had access to a total of eight different IAM user access keys, and was active from two different IPs."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0001","technique":"T1078.004"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--4f4d03a8-4502-5010-997b-9943e254395b","120":"instance--cefe62ac-5b6e-5ead-84fc-b4c632913a73","150":"instance--4d07a740-2467-5b95-ac8d-4a2ee8edd11e","180":"instance--1205f03c-a457-5a0b-87ef-3bbb7aac110f","210":"instance--96e7dc6a-9f86-5f69-8d45-a566303cd4c0","240":"instance--66237af6-bb19-5a51-9fa2-cbc4a96186f5","270":"instance--836dfd42-b475-50ca-9acf-4f11bd32b89f","30":"instance--efe92997-cc5c-538a-90bc-c09ffb1379f4","300":"instance--9c4a24ae-1426-5cb5-9d7c-792e6dd325b7","330":"instance--06c6a74a-ca7d-5703-88ea-a06a0933d21a","60":"instance--5e4f84e5-56b7-5b8f-9bc3-b4d59d371123","90":"instance--019deb6a-bab3-57db-9a53-11e3564bf7a4"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--2","properties":[["name","Probe accessible AWS services"],["description","Based on observed API activity, the attacker had a keen interest in S3, EC2 and RDS services as we observed , and calls for each access key, indicating an attempt to see which of these resources was available to the compromised IAM user."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0007","technique":"T1526"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--0ce35aea-35a2-52ae-a67b-985306bdefe7","120":"instance--312639d5-e6d9-57b1-850d-28f0a1eac2f6","150":"instance--9551a25e-2558-512e-9894-dd64a8d662bf","180":"instance--403becce-e0ad-5dcd-bc14-7c00453907da","210":"instance--2305f501-2712-5ec6-9d4e-1371b011e937","240":"instance--cf1b8cf6-1cbd-5afb-b653-aa693889dab5","270":"instance--1d3dc59a-40a0-5670-aa3e-1304ff762003","30":"instance--77063d4f-503a-5e9b-b622-15aa2cc6a8e7","300":"instance--beaab67f-8a54-5982-8c5d-9d2ed2d42c9f","330":"instance--4d3274ff-ef14-5a53-99be-01575194a98e","60":"instance--4154a6bf-290b-5fce-a557-5dc0f3e700fb","90":"instance--2992bc0b-df57-54e5-a17b-03a964338c09"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--3","properties":[["name","Enumerate security groups"],["description","As soon as the attacker identified a key with considerable permissions, was called to determine the level of application tier access (firewall access) into the victim\u0019s AWS environment."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0043","technique":"T1580"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--0f6e4da7-a5f4-54d7-866f-3bc6e8bcb019","120":"instance--015254b5-0906-577e-b3e3-3899f837d118","150":"instance--f7af5b8c-330a-58d5-b0da-a3d5f0bc6ad0","180":"instance--9f27ab21-2382-567d-b022-74ad5a29bd08","210":"instance--d799eb0a-7600-5b1a-a298-c47a78ceae4b","240":"instance--911c2c52-5974-5e08-b0b6-a9084d57c6ee","270":"instance--286444b4-97a1-58cd-9ca3-cffa04a15351","30":"instance--92192c38-5143-50e0-8c39-a96ea86e32e2","300":"instance--82bb3de0-bea5-5651-a1de-583283258c6d","330":"instance--4f0945c8-f644-50ce-8796-fea52a29dda1","60":"instance--16c43a2d-7356-521d-a507-5922e2c3337b","90":"instance--abce5c62-339a-5ed5-a0b8-dd66136cfe2f"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--4","properties":[["name","Backdoor security groups"],["description","Once these groups were enumerated, the attacker \u001cbackdoored\u001d all of the security groups with a utility similar to . This allowed for any TCP/IP access into the victim\u0019s environment.\n\nAdditional calls were made for specific ingress rules for port 5432 (postgresql) and port 1253, amounting to hundreds of unique Security Group rules created. These enabled the attacker to gain network access to the environment and created additional risks by exposing many AWS service instances (EC2, RDS, etc.) to the internet."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0005","technique":"T1562.007"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--a469636c-0cb2-50b9-92f9-644c8aa98197","120":"instance--d57b3a21-e910-5879-8148-40165cea451a","150":"instance--58250ef4-5bb4-5bf3-b33e-89493bbb395d","180":"instance--3e769cf2-c1e5-5d2e-81d4-892f48ce4d86","210":"instance--f6499e41-749c-5d7f-9346-96c08d0d5dfd","240":"instance--d9dcdfc8-5f42-546a-803a-0efcd5d4cf91","270":"instance--c9afd0f6-97ce-57b2-9d60-3557b6214809","30":"instance--75f82155-f5ff-5619-8bf8-aae22937cab0","300":"instance--25e2d26e-1b35-56bd-b9aa-096c2d3b0e3c","330":"instance--e0483688-da10-5376-8cf2-050bcc3b70f0","60":"instance--1293d9cc-16b2-5c67-a453-bd144aab133a","90":"instance--2b43cd52-10db-5b15-8ad5-c4b59496528b"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--5","properties":[["name","Identify EC2 instances"],["description","A subsequent call identified available EC2 instances to the IAM user."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0007","technique":"T1526"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--54fc1f38-f4e3-523e-b07c-73889b0d8df7","120":"instance--9cf45948-7040-5d7a-a1d5-3cb4db0c1af6","150":"instance--13bb13cc-e02b-51d2-8d7d-40e5613b6e5a","180":"instance--e33bc6ee-771e-54fe-a772-74dfdaad420d","210":"instance--286f51a3-8fc6-55ec-978e-8b05ebda3655","240":"instance--14659696-be77-5460-beb1-4b5eac126e43","270":"instance--f48ed1a6-2895-5cd2-9b1c-e30ac2bc8921","30":"instance--7b803e61-16ac-5720-92cd-8f2a456a52b7","300":"instance--76c24361-5143-5c43-8e4d-707c619e6038","330":"instance--f395cfc7-395a-5001-9552-a4fec6dbc53a","60":"instance--760885bb-9294-5a5b-93a2-a410e1ea4112","90":"instance--8e0d1a12-8611-598d-9a7d-40f2525e4781"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--6","properties":[["name","Create EC2 SSH key pair"],["description","The attacker then created a SSH key pair (our initial lead alert for ) for an existing EC2 instance."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0003","technique":"T1098"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--7cccbcd0-a724-54fb-be4f-ac523d26f7d0","120":"instance--738e44b2-1357-5eb3-82bd-8a0ce8942b72","150":"instance--d31f4735-6339-5929-8d7c-d30863cf166f","180":"instance--2252393d-d801-5931-ad38-4b53374a9880","210":"instance--065b5ad5-023a-5336-b458-e9c9dcda2976","240":"instance--5ea0dd2b-5eac-51f8-855a-4cbcb801bc2d","270":"instance--bba66874-a069-56c6-bb95-967cb3cefc9e","30":"instance--6377c09d-ecb4-5567-a2f4-4dde56ff4f98","300":"instance--ede3430f-b16b-58ae-be71-1d1f1a194336","330":"instance--7772f482-8ee2-569a-b600-7528c065d4e0","60":"instance--98139a98-16b0-54fe-8c77-3473c1b520cd","90":"instance--5cb9cc95-e190-5a68-985d-0a94d39299e6"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--7","properties":[["name","Start EC2 instance"],["description","This instance was not running at the time so the attacker turned it on via a call."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0005","technique":"T1578.005"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--5150f7cc-6f25-5eb3-a6fc-5099ced4caf4","120":"instance--64a408ce-c543-55d6-a9dd-206ce7cadbb2","150":"instance--1b71e413-cfd2-528c-8792-dc7dd1bb9938","180":"instance--aa12ce11-0165-52b6-b72d-e4d9070e9fbb","210":"instance--5d8b0f08-14bc-58f4-9316-b25a92dd09a6","240":"instance--34f96b84-9453-53f2-ae07-d28c04665e6c","270":"instance--415f1d54-1cd4-5ba7-8071-4aa99bc946ac","30":"instance--18834cac-b4c4-57b0-88ea-5a62fdb27cf9","300":"instance--de4f9957-1ac6-5782-86ea-f1a3b6a9ad13","330":"instance--8eff940b-86bb-556f-8c85-c7c47577b3ed","60":"instance--14a123fd-5626-5e69-8257-6dcd64c28ec0","90":"instance--02294ff1-7261-5db8-8e0d-b9e818922053"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--8","properties":[["name","Gain command line access to EC2"],["description","Ultimately, this series of actions resulted in command line access to the targeted EC2 instance, at which point visibility can be a challenge without additional OS logging or security products to investigate instance activity."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0008","technique":"T1021.004"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--35652c79-2c41-5d60-81ba-b5e47aa554bf","120":"instance--53906203-fffb-5af3-b112-44a9b4b49b8f","150":"instance--465fbc8a-7b4c-569f-be00-c0fbc137fcfc","180":"instance--a653c96b-3673-5dfa-968e-188fffe4cc04","210":"instance--6a344cf5-bd5c-52db-84f5-23c7701c7a5e","30":"instance--913561d1-b5f3-54d2-8272-159233dfde54","330":"instance--d59fe52d-c897-5f3a-919a-c2273cb8a8b3","60":"instance--f1fd6a3d-bb83-543d-a379-39d4632978f7","90":"instance--4cd6fce2-0d24-57f0-b161-12a867cd1100","branch:False":"instance--f7e897b3-3607-5ea5-8d15-5f83ba8a60da","branch:True":"instance--39b5ac19-b0dd-5674-a7d9-d75e659fe9ea"},"id":"condition","instance":"attack-condition--1","properties":[["description","If we recall from earlier, we were able to use our robot to determine that no successful AssumeRole calls were made, limiting our response to these IAM users."]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--2ff8b105-17d8-5bc8-9736-a71ca9281068","120":"instance--fe9b11f7-9a07-51c8-93b2-02f34148833b","150":"instance--15f0676c-2f2f-58cf-99a3-b5eade2d286e","180":"instance--cdc5e3d9-a0b4-5995-98a3-d1a29532ffb1","210":"instance--75ed5df8-ff2f-5667-9748-b8587a1ee318","30":"instance--46009917-4258-54e5-9e91-c46c4a45d34d","330":"instance--54845373-a5f0-5af0-b348-5b0a3b4fbe67","60":"instance--f1f8d9a5-1f2a-55c4-af9a-f2629bc0827a","90":"instance--ddfb6e54-4af9-5771-910f-b4c7ba6e9860","branch:False":"instance--64607b7d-a4bd-56e7-9116-7bc21201c8bf","branch:True":"instance--f635d174-aa29-531f-b9c8-0cc481c6c1dd"},"id":"condition","instance":"attack-condition--2","properties":[["description","Once these groups were enumerated, the attacker \u001cbackdoored\u001d all of the security groups with a utility similar to ."]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--64fa8274-9976-53b9-811c-a0e7e805b799","120":"instance--ce384754-4013-5515-ac17-4456e1d80bbb","150":"instance--99275651-db0d-57ec-a13c-6e557a4b9c7c","180":"instance--cbaa25ac-4f14-51f0-9962-f76fe36e7cd6","210":"instance--1c4fda5b-4605-5040-a88a-48f1df4144aa","30":"instance--39743932-1858-5655-a859-b27c0902b87a","330":"instance--c116df79-3c10-5931-96ec-25b4174ae13a","60":"instance--75b926aa-d189-5cd6-bc7b-5a947c88de41","90":"instance--4931e63d-9e52-5183-bbd8-7db1814b0f21","branch:False":"instance--fc00a7ae-0a9a-58b7-b2